<!--
  User-facing strings.

  Conventions:
    - Keep keys descriptive: `feature_action_modifier` (e.g. `basic_button_clear`).
    - One file in `values/` (default English); translations live alongside in
      `values-<locale>/strings.xml` (e.g. `values-hi/strings.xml`). Lint fails
      on a string with no Hindi translation; mark symbols, names and codes
      that never change `translatable="false"` instead.
    - Mark format strings with `xliff:g` so translators know not to alter
      placeholders (added when the first formatted string is introduced).
-->
